        <description>Fiddle bridge wire schema 2: typed Off (On+64) and revision beacon on KS126/KS127. Note durations pinned to 100% (written lengths). Pending Dorico host acceptance. Orchestral unpitched percussion: 20 conduits, 25 bases, 76 add-ons. Specification SHA256: bae5a1d2897ad2a74b5eb7fb394eec2cc0a7b1f2dff5b2f04decee18a3db0fbc</description>
